# Smart HandWritten Note Understanding Service

## Environment Variables

Copy this file to `.env` and fill in your API keys.

```
# Server
PORT=3001
NODE_ENV=development

# MongoDB
MONGODB_URI=mongodb+srv://<username>:<password>@cluster.mongodb.net/smart-notes

# Groq AI (Multi-key rotation and failover supported)
GROQ_API_KEY=your_groq_api_key_here
GROQ_API_KEY_2=your_second_groq_api_key_here
# GROQ_API_KEYS=key1,key2

# Hugging Face (TrOCR)
HUGGINGFACE_API_KEY=your_huggingface_api_key_here
# Must match the PDF Ingestion service model and its Qdrant vector dimension.
# This service runs the model locally through Transformers.js; the first run
# downloads the model into EMBEDDING_CACHE_DIR.
EMBEDDING_MODEL=nomic-ai/nomic-embed-text-v1.5
EMBEDDING_PROVIDER=local-transformers-js
EMBEDDING_DIMENSION=768
EMBEDDING_MAX_TOKENS=8192
EMBEDDING_CACHE_DIR=.cache/embeddings

# File Uploads
MAX_FILE_SIZE_MB=10
UPLOAD_DIR=uploads

# ElevenLabs (optional audio)
ELEVENLABS_API_KEY=your_elevenlabs_api_key_here

# Curriculum Knowledge Base (PostgreSQL)
CURRICULUM_DB_URL=postgresql://<username>:<password>@<host>/<database>?sslmode=require

# Qdrant Vector Knowledge Base
QDRANT_DB_URL=http://localhost:6333
QDRANT_COLLECTION=pdf_knowledge_base
```

